AISDLC_SDD_v0.01/build/reports/abort/CONTEXT-SNAPSHOT-*-auto.md

# SDD test/chaos/TLC run byproducts (simulated-fault reports, regenerated on demand)
AISDLC_SDD_v0.01/build/reports/abort/CONTEXT-SNAPSHOT-*-auto-*.md
AISDLC_SDD_v0.01/build/reports/abort/ABORT-*.md
AISDLC_SDD_v0.01/build/reports/abort/ABORT-RAW-*.yaml
